RandomX, imported from https://github.com/tevador/RandomX
commit 7607fb2faed24d5a679e139a9828d194bbc644a4 (2026-06, after v2.0.1)
License: BSD-3-Clause (LICENSE in this directory), copyright headers kept.

Imported: src/ (x86-64 and ARMv8 JIT, portable interpreter), src/blake2,
src/asm/*.inc. Not imported: the RISC-V code, Windows .asm, tests, CMake.
No source changes. Built into libalgos.a by ../makefile.

Monero mainnet uses RandomX v1 (no RANDOMX_FLAG_V2); the v2 flag is exposed by
the randomx protocol of the stratum (randomx_v2 in the .conf) for future forks.
